<h2 id="provisioning-a-serverless-postgres" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-tighter"><span>Provisioning a Serverless Postgres</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#provisioning-a-serverless-postgres" aria-label="Link to Provisioning a Serverless Postgres"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3.5"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h2>
<p>Using Serverless Postgres database helps you scale down to zero. With Neon, you only have to pay for what you use.</p>
<p>To get started, go to the <a class="group inline" href="https://console.neon.tech/app/projects" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Neon console<span class="whitespace-nowrap no-underline"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="ml-1 inline-block size-3.5! shrink-0 align-[-0.125em]"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 0h14v14H0z" opacity="0.2"></path><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" d="M9.915 8.885V4.08H5.11M9.625 4.375 4.083 9.917"></path></svg></span></a> and enter the name of your choice as the project name.</p>
<p>You will then be presented with a dialog that provides a connecting string of your database. You can enable the <strong>Connection pooling</strong> toggle for a pooled connection string.</p>
<p><span aria-owns="rmiz-modal-" data-rmiz=""><span data-rmiz-content="not-found" style="visibility:visible"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="704" height="447" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent;width:100%;height:100%" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fguides%2Fimages%2Fllamaindex-postgres-search-images%2Fcreate-database.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_3oQTwA9tDsjxX7vtodZE2SLAZ1X7 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fguides%2Fimages%2Fllamaindex-postgres-search-images%2Fcreate-database.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_3oQTwA9tDsjxX7vtodZE2SLAZ1X7 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fguides%2Fimages%2Fllamaindex-postgres-search-images%2Fcreate-database.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_3oQTwA9tDsjxX7vtodZE2SLAZ1X7"/></span></span></p>
<p>All Neon connection strings have the following format:</p>
<figure class="code-block group/code-block relative flex flex-col [&amp;_pre]:min-w-full rounded-none border border-gray-new-80 dark:border-gray-new-20 [&amp;&gt;pre]:my-0 [&amp;&gt;pre]:rounded-none [&amp;&gt;pre]:bg-white! [&amp;&gt;pre]:py-4 [&amp;&gt;pre]:dark:bg-black-pure!" data-has-filename="false" data-line-numbers="false"><pre class="shiki css-variables" style="background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)" tabindex="0" data-language="bash"><code class="grid"><span class="line" data-line="1"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-function)">postgres://</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)">&lt;user&gt;:&lt;password&gt;@&lt;endpoint_hostname&gt;.neon.tech:&lt;port&gt;/&lt;dbname&gt;?sslmode=require</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)">&amp;</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)">channel_binding</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">=</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)">require</span></span></code></pre><button class="invisible absolute right-4 border border-gray-new-80 bg-white p-1.5 text-gray-new-40 opacity-0 transition-[background-color,opacity,visibility] duration-200 group-hover/code-block:visible group-hover/code-block:opacity-100 hover:bg-gray-new-90 dark:border-gray-new-20 dark:bg-black-pure dark:text-gray-new-60 dark:hover:bg-gray-new-8 lg:visible lg:opacity-100 top-[min(1rem,calc(50%-.8175rem))]" type="button" aria-label="Copy"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-current"><rect width="8.995" height="9.002" x="5.939" y="5.935" stroke="currentColor" rx="1"></rect><path fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2.434.935a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-1.5 1.5v7.001a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 1.5 1.5h1.499a.5.5 0 0 0 0-1h-1.5a.5.5 0 0 1-.5-.5V2.435a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h6.995a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v1.5a.5.5 0 1 0 1 0v-1.5a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-1.5-1.5z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button></figure>
<ul>
<li><code>user</code> is the database user.</li>
<li><code>password</code> is the database user’s password.</li>
<li><code>endpoint_hostname</code> is the host with neon.tech as the <a class="group inline" href="https://www.cloudflare.com/en-gb/learning/dns/top-level-domain/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">TLD<span class="whitespace-nowrap no-underline"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="ml-1 inline-block size-3.5! shrink-0 align-[-0.125em]"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 0h14v14H0z" opacity="0.2"></path><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" d="M9.915 8.885V4.08H5.11M9.625 4.375 4.083 9.917"></path></svg></span></a>.</li>
<li><code>port</code> is the Neon port number. The default port number is 5432.</li>
<li><code>dbname</code> is the name of the database. “neondb” is the default database created with each Neon project.</li>
<li><code>?sslmode=require&amp;channel_binding=require</code> optional query parameters that enforce the <a class="group inline" href="https://www.cloudflare.com/en-gb/learning/ssl/what-is-ssl/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">SSL<span class="whitespace-nowrap no-underline"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="ml-1 inline-block size-3.5! shrink-0 align-[-0.125em]"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 0h14v14H0z" opacity="0.2"></path><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" d="M9.915 8.885V4.08H5.11M9.625 4.375 4.083 9.917"></path></svg></span></a> mode and channel binding while connecting to the Postgres instance for better security.</li>
</ul>
<p>Save this connecting string somewhere safe to be used as the <code>POSTGRES_URL</code> further in the guide. Proceed further in this guide to create a Astro application.</p>
<h2 id="create-a-new-astro-application" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-tighter"><span>Create a new Astro application</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#create-a-new-astro-application" aria-label="Link to Create a new Astro application"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3.5"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h2>
<p>Let’s get started by creating a new Astro project. Open your terminal and run the following command:</p>
<figure class="code-block group/code-block relative flex flex-col [&amp;_pre]:min-w-full rounded-none border border-gray-new-80 dark:border-gray-new-20 [&amp;&gt;pre]:my-0 [&amp;&gt;pre]:rounded-none [&amp;&gt;pre]:bg-white! [&amp;&gt;pre]:py-4 [&amp;&gt;pre]:dark:bg-black-pure!" data-has-filename="false" data-line-numbers="false"><pre class="shiki css-variables" style="background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)" tabindex="0" data-language="bash"><code class="grid"><span class="line" data-line="1"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-function)">npm</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> create</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> astro@latest</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> my-app</span></span></code></pre><button class="invisible absolute right-4 border border-gray-new-80 bg-white p-1.5 text-gray-new-40 opacity-0 transition-[background-color,opacity,visibility] duration-200 group-hover/code-block:visible group-hover/code-block:opacity-100 hover:bg-gray-new-90 dark:border-gray-new-20 dark:bg-black-pure dark:text-gray-new-60 dark:hover:bg-gray-new-8 lg:visible lg:opacity-100 top-[min(1rem,calc(50%-.8175rem))]" type="button" aria-label="Copy"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-current"><rect width="8.995" height="9.002" x="5.939" y="5.935" stroke="currentColor" rx="1"></rect><path fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2.434.935a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-1.5 1.5v7.001a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 1.5 1.5h1.499a.5.5 0 0 0 0-1h-1.5a.5.5 0 0 1-.5-.5V2.435a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h6.995a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v1.5a.5.5 0 1 0 1 0v-1.5a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-1.5-1.5z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button></figure>
<p><code>npm create astro</code> is the recommended way to scaffold an Astro project quickly.</p>
<p>When prompted, choose:</p>
<ul>
<li><code>Empty</code> when prompted on how to start the new project.</li>
<li><code>Yes</code> when prompted if plan to write Typescript.</li>
<li><code>Strict</code> when prompted how strict Typescript should be.</li>
<li><code>Yes</code> when prompted to install dependencies.</li>
<li><code>Yes</code> when prompted to initialize a git repository.</li>
</ul>
<p>Once that’s done, you can move into the project directory and start the app:</p>
<figure class="code-block group/code-block relative flex flex-col [&amp;_pre]:min-w-full rounded-none border border-gray-new-80 dark:border-gray-new-20 [&amp;&gt;pre]:my-0 [&amp;&gt;pre]:rounded-none [&amp;&gt;pre]:bg-white! [&amp;&gt;pre]:py-4 [&amp;&gt;pre]:dark:bg-black-pure!" data-has-filename="false" data-line-numbers="false"><pre class="shiki css-variables" style="background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)" tabindex="0" data-language="bash"><code class="grid"><span class="line" data-line="1"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-function)">cd</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> my-app</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="2"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-function)">npm</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> run</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> dev</span></span></code></pre><button class="invisible absolute right-4 border border-gray-new-80 bg-white p-1.5 text-gray-new-40 opacity-0 transition-[background-color,opacity,visibility] duration-200 group-hover/code-block:visible group-hover/code-block:opacity-100 hover:bg-gray-new-90 dark:border-gray-new-20 dark:bg-black-pure dark:text-gray-new-60 dark:hover:bg-gray-new-8 lg:visible lg:opacity-100 top-4" type="button" aria-label="Copy"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-current"><rect width="8.995" height="9.002" x="5.939" y="5.935" stroke="currentColor" rx="1"></rect><path fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2.434.935a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-1.5 1.5v7.001a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 1.5 1.5h1.499a.5.5 0 0 0 0-1h-1.5a.5.5 0 0 1-.5-.5V2.435a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h6.995a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v1.5a.5.5 0 1 0 1 0v-1.5a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-1.5-1.5z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button></figure>
<p>The app should be running on <a class="group inline" href="http://localhost:4321/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">localhost:4321<span class="whitespace-nowrap no-underline"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="ml-1 inline-block size-3.5! shrink-0 align-[-0.125em]"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 0h14v14H0z" opacity="0.2"></path><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" d="M9.915 8.885V4.08H5.11M9.625 4.375 4.083 9.917"></path></svg></span></a>. Let&#x27;s close the development server for now.</p>
<p>Next, execute the command in your terminal window below to install the necessary libraries and packages for building the application:</p>
<figure class="code-block group/code-block relative flex flex-col [&amp;_pre]:min-w-full rounded-none border border-gray-new-80 dark:border-gray-new-20 [&amp;&gt;pre]:my-0 [&amp;&gt;pre]:rounded-none [&amp;&gt;pre]:bg-white! [&amp;&gt;pre]:py-4 [&amp;&gt;pre]:dark:bg-black-pure!" data-has-filename="false" data-line-numbers="false"><pre class="shiki css-variables" style="background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)" tabindex="0" data-language="bash"><code class="grid"><span class="line" data-line="1"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-function)">npm</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> install</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> dotenv</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> llamaindex@0.3.4</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> uuid</span></span></code></pre><button class="invisible absolute right-4 border border-gray-new-80 bg-white p-1.5 text-gray-new-40 opacity-0 transition-[background-color,opacity,visibility] duration-200 group-hover/code-block:visible group-hover/code-block:opacity-100 hover:bg-gray-new-90 dark:border-gray-new-20 dark:bg-black-pure dark:text-gray-new-60 dark:hover:bg-gray-new-8 lg:visible lg:opacity-100 top-[min(1rem,calc(50%-.8175rem))]" type="button" aria-label="Copy"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-current"><rect width="8.995" height="9.002" x="5.939" y="5.935" stroke="currentColor" rx="1"></rect><path fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2.434.935a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-1.5 1.5v7.001a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 1.5 1.5h1.499a.5.5 0 0 0 0-1h-1.5a.5.5 0 0 1-.5-.5V2.435a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h6.995a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v1.5a.5.5 0 1 0 1 0v-1.5a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-1.5-1.5z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button></figure>
<p>The above command installs the following packages:</p>
<ul>
<li><a class="group inline" href="https://npmjs.com/package/dotenv" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">dotenv<span class="whitespace-nowrap no-underline"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="ml-1 inline-block size-3.5! shrink-0 align-[-0.125em]"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 0h14v14H0z" opacity="0.2"></path><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" d="M9.915 8.885V4.08H5.11M9.625 4.375 4.083 9.917"></path></svg></span></a>: A library for handling environment variables.</li>
<li><a class="group inline" href="https://npmjs.com/package/llamaindex" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LlamaIndex<span class="whitespace-nowrap no-underline"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="ml-1 inline-block size-3.5! shrink-0 align-[-0.125em]"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 0h14v14H0z" opacity="0.2"></path><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" d="M9.915 8.885V4.08H5.11M9.625 4.375 4.083 9.917"></path></svg></span></a>: A data framework for creating LLM applications.</li>
<li><a class="group inline" href="https://npmjs.com/package/uuid" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">uuid<span class="whitespace-nowrap no-underline"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="ml-1 inline-block size-3.5! shrink-0 align-[-0.125em]"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 0h14v14H0z" opacity="0.2"></path><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" d="M9.915 8.885V4.08H5.11M9.625 4.375 4.083 9.917"></path></svg></span></a>: A library to generate RFC-compliant UUIDs in JavaScript.</li>
</ul>
<p>Then, make the following additions in your <code>tsconfig.json</code> file to make relative imports within the project easier:</p>
<figure class="code-block group/code-block relative flex flex-col [&amp;_pre]:min-w-full rounded-none border border-gray-new-80 dark:border-gray-new-20 [&amp;&gt;pre]:my-0 [&amp;&gt;pre]:rounded-none [&amp;&gt;pre]:bg-white! [&amp;&gt;pre]:py-4 [&amp;&gt;pre]:dark:bg-black-pure!" data-has-filename="false" data-line-numbers="false"><pre class="shiki css-variables has-diff" style="background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)" tabindex="0" data-language="json"><code class="grid"><span class="line" data-line="1"><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)">{</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="2"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">  &quot;extends&quot;</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)">:</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)"> &quot;astro/tsconfigs/base&quot;</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)">,</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="3"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">  &quot;compilerOptions&quot;</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)">:</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> {</span></span>

<span class="line diff add" data-line="5"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">    &quot;baseUrl&quot;</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)">:</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)"> &quot;.&quot;</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)">,</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="6"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">    &quot;paths&quot;</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)">:</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> {</span></span>

